      <h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Cloud Services</h1>
      <p>Cloud adoption is no longer a question of if, but how. MEAICON provides cloud services including migration strategy and execution, hybrid architecture design, cloud-native development, and container orchestration for organisations across the Middle East and Africa.</p>
      <p>We help you adopt cloud on your terms — whether that means a full migration, a hybrid model, or modernising applications for cloud-native deployment.</p>
