        </div>
        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>MEAICON's cloud practice covers the full adoption lifecycle — from initial strategy and workload assessment through migration execution and ongoing optimisation. We do not push every workload to the cloud indiscriminately; we help you evaluate which workloads benefit from cloud, which should remain on-premises, and how to architect a hybrid model that gives you the best of both.</p>
          <p>For organisations building new applications, we bring cloud-native expertise — containerisation, orchestration, serverless architectures, and microservices design. We implement infrastructure as code, CI/CD pipelines, and observability tooling so your cloud environment is reproducible, automated, and transparent.</p>
